  "code": "LTGSP498",
  "title": "Stop vulnerabilities in AI-generated code before they ship",
  "description": "Apps ship in hours with Copilot and Cursor. Vibes are great, until the vulns show up. AI code introduces new risks: hallucinated packages and insecure patterns. This session breaks down Aikido's real-world research on why traditional AppSec fails 'vibe coding' and how attackers exploit this shift. We’ll cover AI vuln patterns, execution vectors, supply chain risks, and practical guardrails. Vibe coding is inevitable; shipping vulns isn’t. Walk away with a security blueprint.\n\nSeating for this session is first-come, first-served. Add it to your schedule to plan your day and arrive early to secure a spot.",
